    "en": {
      "trackName": "Sky Ace 3D",
      "description": "Experience fast-paced 3D aerial combat on Apple Watch.\n\nSky Ace 3D brings real-time dogfighting to your wrist, featuring smooth 3D graphics and intuitive one-handed controls designed specifically for the Digital Crown.\n\nDive into intense aerial battles as you maneuver through enemy fire, track hostile aircraft, fight bosses and sharpen your skills across progressively challenging levels.\n\nBuilt exclusively for Apple Watch, the game is optimized for short, engaging play sessions while delivering a surprisingly deep and immersive 3D experience, all on a compact screen.\n\nKey Features\n\n• Real-time 3D aerial combat optimized for watchOS.\n• Digital Crown Controls: Smooth, one-handed flight and combat using the Digital Crown.\n• Fast Dogfights: Engage enemy aircraft in quick battles.\n• Progressive Challenge: Face increasingly difficult waves of enemy planes.\n• Designed for the Wrist: Short sessions, responsive controls, and performance tuned specifically for Apple Watch hardware.",
